<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/30/eng@/~cl_4__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for subsection (2) the following subsection: “(2) The Audit Oversight Board shall consist of the following members who shall be appointed by the Board: (a) a non-executive chairman; (b) an executive officer; and (c) five non-executive members.”;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/30/eng@/~cl_4__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/30/eng@/~cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/30/eng@/~cl_4__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "b" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/30/eng@> .
